{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">林峯與張馨月婚後育有一女「格格」（Luna），一家三口生活溫馨甜蜜。轉眼間，女兒 Luna 已經迎來 6 歲生日。向來寵愛妻女的林峯特別包下豪華遊艇出海，為愛女精心策劃了一場浪漫又溫馨的夜間遊艇生日派對。隨後，張馨月在社交平台分享了一組現場慶生照片，一家三口的溫馨合照以及夫妻二人甜蜜放閃的畫面，隨即吸引大批網民關注與祝福。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f3e06bd3-71fb-4601-bc22-995aab915b4f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026b5PKpzW7fl1785990354.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f3e06bd3-71fb-4601-bc22-995aab915b4f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">船艙內部佈置得精緻且充滿童趣，特別安排了大型粉紅氣球裝置，不僅有 6 歲的巨型「6」字氣球，更搭配了各式粉嫩花朵氣球。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">餐桌上擺放著一款印有「Luna HAPPY 6TH BIRTHDAY!」字樣的花朵生日蛋糕，設計精美，儀式感十足。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在拍攝一家三口的全家福時，林峯溫馨地攬着張馨月的肩膀，畫面溫馨動人，足見夫妻感情深厚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">照片曝光後，網民紛紛留言送上祝福：「祝 Luna 生日快樂！一家三口太甜蜜了」、「林峯真的是一位滿分的好爸爸」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ed159962-6e23-4bbd-bdcb-3f2d6fca28ad.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026b59H95XLAs1785990354.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ed159962-6e23-4bbd-bdcb-3f2d6fca28ad.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"88ce11f4-30a8-4763-be4c-5a9aff503160.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026knFg9JfTJs1785990354.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"88ce11f4-30a8-4763-be4c-5a9aff503160.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T06:00:00.765543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}